BBUUGGSS
     Resampling is low quality; down-sampling especially should be avoided
     when recording.

     If --aa _o_f_f is used, ssnnddiioodd creates sub-devices to expose first and then
     opens the audio hardware on demand.  Technically, this allows ssnnddiioodd to
     attempt to use one of the sub-devices it exposes as an audio device, cre‐
     ating a deadlock.  There's nothing to prevent the user from shooting
     themselves in the foot by creating such a deadlock.

